<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms<span class="ltx_pubnotes"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_thanks"><span class="ltx_note_name">Thanks: </span>This work is to appear in Mobihoc 2025. This work is supported in part by SUTD Kickstarter Initiative (SKI) Grant with no. SKI 2021_04_07; and in part by the Joint SMU-SUTD Grant with no. 22-LKCSB-SMU-053.</span></span></span></h1>
