<p id="A3.p9.4" class="ltx_p">The first line in (<a href="#A3.E40" title="In Appendix C Proof for Lemma ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">40</span></a>) is:</p>
<table id="A3.EGx50" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
