<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex146.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+N\left(1-\int^{1}_{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+1}}P(r)^{N}dr\right)(T-T_{1})-N\sum^{T-T_{1}-1}_{\tau=1}\int^{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+\tau}}_{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+\tau+1}}P(r)^{N}F(r)^{\tau}dr(T-T_{1}-\tau)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msub></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>τ</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+N\left(1-\int^{1}_{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+1}}P(r)^{N}dr\right)(T-T_{1})-N\sum^{T-T_{1}-1}_{\tau=1}\int^{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+\tau}}_{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+\tau+1}}P(r)^{N}F(r)^{\tau}dr(T-T_{1}-\tau),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p7.6" class="ltx_p">where equation (a) utilizes the fact that <math id="A6.p7.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{u}_{T}=\mu" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>T</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{u}_{T}=\mu</annotation></semantics></math>. Then we complete the proof of (<a href="#S4.E24" title="In Proposition 4.3. ‣ 4.2. Optimal Decentralized Communication Mechanism ‣ 4. Dcentralized Communication Mechanism for Non-myopic Agents ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<div id="A6.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p8.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A6.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>, in <math id="A6.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{1,\ldots,T+1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{1,\ldots,T+1\}</annotation></semantics></math>, denote the random variable representing exploration time by non-myopic agents under communication restriction mechanism <math id="A6.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{2}=[T]\setminus\{T_{1}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{2}=[T]\setminus\{T_{1}\}</annotation></semantics></math> in the total process. Then expectation of <math id="A6.p8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> is</p>
<table id="A6.EGx87" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A6.Ex147"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex147.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\tau]=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\tau]=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex147.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum^{T+1}_{t=1}t\mathbb{P}(\tau=t)=\sum^{T+1}_{t=1}\mathbb{P}(\tau\geq t)=1+\sum^{T_{1}+1}_{t=2}F(u_{t-1})^{t-1}+\sum^{T+1}_{t=T_{1}+2}P(u_{t-1})^{N}F(u_{t-1})^{t-T_{1}-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>ℙ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>ℙ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum^{T+1}_{t=1}t\mathbb{P}(\tau=t)=\sum^{T+1}_{t=1}\mathbb{P}(\tau\geq t)=1+\sum^{T_{1}+1}_{t=2}F(u_{t-1})^{t-1}+\sum^{T+1}_{t=T_{1}+2}P(u_{t-1})^{N}F(u_{t-1})^{t-T_{1}-1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A6.Ex148"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex148.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>=</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A6.Ex148.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 1+\sum^{T_{1}}_{t=1}F(u_{t})^{t}+\sum^{T}_{t=T_{1}+1}P(u_{t})^{N}F(u_{t})^{t-T_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 1+\sum^{T_{1}}_{t=1}F(u_{t})^{t}+\sum^{T}_{t=T_{1}+1}P(u_{t})^{N}F(u_{t})^{t-T_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A6.p8.2" class="ltx_p">which completes the proof of (<a href="#S4.E25" title="In Proposition 4.3. ‣ 4.2. Optimal Decentralized Communication Mechanism ‣ 4. Dcentralized Communication Mechanism for Non-myopic Agents ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a>).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#S4.Thmtheorem4" title="Theorem 4.4. ‣ 4.2. Optimal Decentralized Communication Mechanism ‣ 4. Dcentralized Communication Mechanism for Non-myopic Agents ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.4</span></a></h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The sequence <math id="A7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math> cannot be expressed in a closed-form solution and must be determined using numerical methods based on equations (<a href="#S4.E22" title="In Proposition 4.3. ‣ 4.2. Optimal Decentralized Communication Mechanism ‣ 4. Dcentralized Communication Mechanism for Non-myopic Agents ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a>) and (<a href="#S4.E23" title="In Proposition 4.3. ‣ 4.2. Optimal Decentralized Communication Mechanism ‣ 4. Dcentralized Communication Mechanism for Non-myopic Agents ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a>). We rewrite equations (<a href="#S4.E22" title="In Proposition 4.3. ‣ 4.2. Optimal Decentralized Communication Mechanism ‣ 4. Dcentralized Communication Mechanism for Non-myopic Agents ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a>) and (<a href="#S4.E23" title="In Proposition 4.3. ‣ 4.2. Optimal Decentralized Communication Mechanism ‣ 4. Dcentralized Communication Mechanism for Non-myopic Agents ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a>) as follows, and the solution <math id="A7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math> corresponds to the roots of these functions:</p>
<table id="A7.EGx88" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A7.Ex149"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex149.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle g_{t}(u_{1}(T_{1}),\ldots,u_{T_{1}}(T_{1}))=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle g_{t}(u_{1}(T_{1}),\ldots,u_{T_{1}}(T_{1}))=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A7.Ex150"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex150.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\left\{\begin{aligned} &amp;u_{t}(T_{1})-\mu-(T_{1}-t)\left(\int^{1}_{u_{t}(T_{1})}1-F(r)dr\right)-(T-T_{1})\int^{1}_{u_{t}(T_{1})}P(r)^{N-1}(1-F(r))dr,\text{if }u_{t}(T_{1})&gt;u_{T_{1}+1}(T_{1}),\\
&amp;u_{t}(T_{1})-\mu-(T_{1}-t)\left(\int^{1}_{u_{t}(T_{1})}1-F(r)dr\right)-(T-T_{1})\int^{1}_{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+1}}P(r)^{N-1}(1-F(r))dr+\sum^{k-1}_{j=1}(T-T_{1}-j)\int^{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+j}}_{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+j+1}}P(r)^{N-1}F(r)^{j}(1-F(r))dr\\
&amp;-(T-T_{1}-k)\int^{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+k}}_{u_{t}(T_{1})}P(r)^{N-1}F(r)^{k}(1-F(r))dr,\;\;\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\text{if }\bar{u}_{T_{1}+k}&gt;u_{t}(T_{1})&gt;\bar{u}_{T_{1}+k+1},t=1,\ldots,T_{1},\end{aligned}\right." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="0pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">d</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></msubsup></mstyle><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0em">𝑑</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo>∫</mo></mstyle><msup><mrow></mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo rspace="12.727em">,</mo><mtext>if </mtext><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>u</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\{\begin{aligned} &amp;u_{t}(T_{1})-\mu-(T_{1}-t)\left(\int^{1}_{u_{t}(T_{1})}1-F(r)dr\right)-(T-T_{1})\int^{1}_{u_{t}(T_{1})}P(r)^{N-1}(1-F(r))dr,\text{if }u_{t}(T_{1})&gt;u_{T_{1}+1}(T_{1}),\\
&amp;u_{t}(T_{1})-\mu-(T_{1}-t)\left(\int^{1}_{u_{t}(T_{1})}1-F(r)dr\right)-(T-T_{1})\int^{1}_{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+1}}P(r)^{N-1}(1-F(r))dr+\sum^{k-1}_{j=1}(T-T_{1}-j)\int^{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+j}}_{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+j+1}}P(r)^{N-1}F(r)^{j}(1-F(r))dr\\
&amp;-(T-T_{1}-k)\int^{\bar{u}_{T_{1}+k}}_{u_{t}(T_{1})}P(r)^{N-1}F(r)^{k}(1-F(r))dr,\;\;\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad\text{if }\bar{u}_{T_{1}+k}&gt;u_{t}(T_{1})&gt;\bar{u}_{T_{1}+k+1},t=1,\ldots,T_{1},\end{aligned}\right.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A7.Ex151"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex151.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\bar{g}_{t}(\bar{u}_{t})=\bar{u}_{t}-\mu-(T-t)\left(\int^{1}_{\bar{u}_{t}}1-F(r)dr\right),t=1,\ldots,T." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>g</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mstyle><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\bar{g}_{t}(\bar{u}_{t})=\bar{u}_{t}-\mu-(T-t)\left(\int^{1}_{\bar{u}_{t}}1-F(r)dr\right),t=1,\ldots,T.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A7.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Define <math id="A7.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{u}(T_{1})=(u_{1}(T_{1}),\ldots,u_{T_{1}}(T_{1}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐮</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{u}(T_{1})=(u_{1}(T_{1}),\ldots,u_{T_{1}}(T_{1}))</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A7.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{g}(\cdot)=(g_{1}(\cdot),\ldots,g_{T_{1}}(\cdot))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{g}(\cdot)=(g_{1}(\cdot),\ldots,g_{T_{1}}(\cdot))</annotation></semantics></math>. Our algorithm first obtains <math id="A7.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\bar{u}_{t}\}_{t=1}^{T}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\bar{u}_{t}\}_{t=1}^{T}</annotation></semantics></math> by finding the roots of <math id="A7.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> equations <math id="A7.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{g}_{t}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>g</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{g}_{t}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math> using Newton’s method, then takes it as the initial solution for the Newton’s method for <math id="A7.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Solving <math id="A7.p2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math> requires the Jacobian matrix <math id="A7.p2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{J}(\cdot)=(J_{ij}(\cdot)),i,j\in\{1,\ldots,T_{1}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐉</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{J}(\cdot)=(J_{ij}(\cdot)),i,j\in\{1,\ldots,T_{1}\}</annotation></semantics></math> of <math id="A7.p2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{g}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{g}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A7.EGx89" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A7.Ex152"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex152.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle J_{tt}(\mathbf{u}(T_{1}))=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>𝐮</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle J_{tt}(\mathbf{u}(T_{1}))=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex152.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\begin{cases}1+(1-F(u_{t}(T_{1})))\left((T_{1}-t)+(T-T_{1})P(u_{t}(T_{1}))^{N-1}\right),&amp;\text{if }u_{t}(T_{1})&gt;u_{T_{1}+1}(T_{1})\\
1+(1-F(u_{t}(T_{1})))\left((T_{1}-t)+(T-T_{1}-i)P(u_{t}(T_{1}))^{N-1}F(u_{t}(T_{1}))^{i}\right),&amp;\text{if }u_{T_{1}+i}(T_{1})&gt;u_{t}(T_{1})&gt;u_{T_{1}+i+1}(T_{1})\\
\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\begin{cases}1+(1-F(u_{t}(T_{1})))\left((T_{1}-t)+(T-T_{1})P(u_{t}(T_{1}))^{N-1}\right),&amp;\text{if }u_{t}(T_{1})&gt;u_{T_{1}+1}(T_{1})\\
1+(1-F(u_{t}(T_{1})))\left((T_{1}-t)+(T-T_{1}-i)P(u_{t}(T_{1}))^{N-1}F(u_{t}(T_{1}))^{i}\right),&amp;\text{if }u_{T_{1}+i}(T_{1})&gt;u_{t}(T_{1})&gt;u_{T_{1}+i+1}(T_{1})\\
\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A7.Ex153"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex153.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle J_{ti}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle J_{ti}=</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A7.Ex153.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle 0,t\neq i," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>≠</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle 0,t\neq i,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A7.p2.2" class="ltx_p">which only has non-zero entries on the diagonal. We provide the Newton’s method for <math id="A7.p2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{u_{t}(T_{1})\}_{t=1}^{T_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math> in steps 4-5 in Alg. <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ 4.2. Optimal Decentralized Communication Mechanism ‣ 4. Dcentralized Communication Mechanism for Non-myopic Agents ‣ Human-in-the-loop Learning Through Decentralized Communication Mechanisms" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> as follows:</p>
<ul id="A7.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A7.I1.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">a</span> 
<div id="A7.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">initialize solution <math id="A7.I1.ix1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{u}^{(0)}(T_{1})=\{\bar{u}_{t}\}_{t=1}^{T_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>u</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{u}^{(0)}(T_{1})=\{\bar{u}_{t}\}_{t=1}^{T_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A7.I1.ix1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>=0;</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A7.I1.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">b</span> 
<div id="A7.I1.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Solve <math id="A7.I1.ix2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> by equation <math id="A7.I1.ix2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{J}(\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1}))\Delta\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})=-\mathbf{g}(\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐉</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{J}(\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1}))\Delta\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})=-\mathbf{g}(\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1}))</annotation></semantics></math>;</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A7.I1.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">c</span> 
<div id="A7.I1.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.I1.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">update the solution as <math id="A7.I1.ix3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{u}^{(k+1)}(T_{1})=\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})+\Delta\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{u}^{(k+1)}(T_{1})=\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})+\Delta\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>;</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A7.I1.ix4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">d</span> 
<div id="A7.I1.ix4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.I1.ix4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Repeat the iteration, and end the process when <math id="A7.I1.ix4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathbf{g}(\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1}))|&lt;\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>𝐠</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathbf{g}(\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1}))|&lt;\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A7.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The primary computational complexity of Newton’s method stems from solving the linear equation for <math id="A7.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐮</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{u}^{(k)}(T_{1})</annotation></semantics></math> in step b, resulting in a complexity of <math id="A7.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(T)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(T)</annotation></semantics></math> for our problem. Given a specific <math id="A7.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, the complexity of the iteration step remains constant, independent of <math id="A7.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>. Therefore, when scanning through all possible <math id="A7.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> values to identify the optimal one-time communication mechanism <math id="A7.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}_{2}^{*}=[T]\setminus\{T_{1}^{*}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}_{2}^{*}=[T]\setminus\{T_{1}^{*}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, the overall complexity escalates to <math id="A7.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="O(T^{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(T^{2})</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
</article>
</div>
</div>
